<title>USA: Alpine sees Q3 sales of about $52.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Alpine sees Q3 sales of about $52.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MAPLEWOOD, N.J. 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alpine Lace Brands Inc said Tuesday it estimates net income after taxes at about $650,000 or $0.10 per share on sales of about $52.7 million for the third quarter ending September 30.</p>
<p>That would be down from the company's $1 million net income after taxes or $0.18 per share for the third quarter of 1995, when sales were $37.2 million.</p>
<p>In 1995's third quarter, tax loss carry forwards reduced the effective tax rate to 18 percent versus 38 percent in 1996, the company said.</p>
</text>
